{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06533","headline":"效古二首 一 · 储光羲","name":"效古二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨登凉风台，暮走邯郸道。\n曜灵何赫烈，四野无青草。\n大军北集燕，天子西居镐。\n妇人役州县，丁男事征讨。\n老幼相别离，哭泣无昏早。\n稼穑既殄绝，川泽复枯槁。\n旷哉远此忧，冥冥商山皓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}